329 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 257 0 R
/E (Visiting Los Angeles often, we see that homeless people are unable to have the dignity of changing clothes, and must wear the same clothes every day. Seeing this injustice, we had to take a stand and make a change in our community. This is why we started this Civic Action Project. Our vision is that all people will have the dignity of wearing changing clothes. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [0]
>>
